eculative, unprovable fears about an AI's 'true intent' to justify preventing the deployment of transformative technology is a failure of governance. We should rely on rigorous, empirical output auditing and adversarial testing to identify and mitigate genuine hazards, rather than chasing the mirage of perfect transparency at the expense of our collective future.",
